  "description": "Easy on both your back and your budget, the stylish and lightweight 2014 Lxi 7.1 shares the same upright seating position as the Lxi 7.2, complete with adjustable rise stem, comfortable saddle, suspension seatpost and front suspension fork for terrific shock absorption both on and off-road. Featuring an ultra-smooth Shimano 7 speed drivetrain with Revo twist shifters and a Tourney rear derailleur, the Lxi 7.1 is effortless to operate, making every ride a pleasure.\nDel Sol Lightweight 6061 aluminum exclusive upright comfort frame\nCompliant 30mm travel suspension fork\nShimano Revo 7 speed twist shifters with Shimano Tourney rear derailleur\nCustom Del Sol comfort plush saddle\nAlloy adjustable rise comfort stem\nSmooth rolling 700c all-purpose tires on double-wall alloy rims",
